{
  "format": "blipblop-strings",
  "version": 1,
  "strings": [
    {"id": 1, "text": "Oh no! The poor old man has been killed!"},
    {"id": 2, "text": "Yeah! Looks like he's been tortured too."},
    {"id": 3, "text": "Those responsible for this infamy will pay, I swear!"},
    {"id": 4, "text": "Your death will be avenged!"},
    {"id": 10, "text": "The pathetic leader of this bunch of scum is trying to escape."},
    {"id": 11, "text": "He probably understood he wouldn't stand a chance against us."},
    {"id": 12, "text": "Let's leave this stinkin' place. I'm sick of it!"},
    {"id": 13, "text": "Who are these guys?"},
    {"id": 14, "text": "We are the Snuff Elite Squad. You won't leave this place alive unless you defeat us!"},
    {"id": 15, "text": "Elite squad, my ass! "},
    {"id": 16, "text": "Finally... Here's their base."},
    {"id": 17, "text": "At last! I'm ready for some real action!"},
    {"id": 18, "text": "It's time to use our secret weapon."},
    {"id": 19, "text": "YOU CAN NOW USE THE COW BOMB!"},
    {"id": 100, "text": "DEFUSE THE 3 BOMBS!"},
    {"id": 101, "text": "2 MORE TO GO..."},
    {"id": 102, "text": "GOTTA KILL'EM ALL!"},
    {"id": 103, "text": "ONE BOMB REMAINING...."},
    {"id": 104, "text": "USE THE SWITCH ON THE RIGHT!"},
    {"id": 105, "text": "GET ON THE LIFT AND "},
    {"id": 106, "text": "DEFUSE THE BOMB!"},
    {"id": 107, "text": "WELL DONE!"},
    {"id": 108, "text": "NOW KILL THE REST OF THEM!"},
    {"id": 200, "text": "Can't you read? Balls aren't allowed in this club!"},
    {"id": 201, "text": "Sorry teddy, but we have to enter, even if we must kick your sweet ass for it."},
    {"id": 202, "text": "You fool! I am a Jedi master! The force is on my side!"},
    {"id": 203, "text": "Sure. And the gun is on mine!"},
    {"id": 204, "text": "Hey you! Raise your fucking hands above your head."},
    {"id": 205, "text": "Let's catch this bastard!"},
    {"id": 206, "text": "GET HIM QUICKLY!"},
    {"id": 207, "text": "I'm the great undead Scare Bears’ ruler! All living creatures are doomed here!"},
    {"id": 208, "text": "Really? I wouldn't bet on it."},
    {"id": 209, "text": "You! So, you survived the plane attack!"},
    {"id": 210, "text": "What! You were behind this!"},
    {
      "id": 211,
      "text": "You brainless ball! This is deeper than you think. You shouldn't have disturbed the high council plans."
    },
    {"id": 212, "text": "What plans? What high council?"},
    {"id": 213, "text": "I've wasted enough time with you. So, you won't mind if I leave."},
    {
      "id": 300,
      "text": "I must compliment you. I didn't think you would make it so far. However, your journey ends here. I'll take care of you myself!"
    },
    {"id": 301, "text": "Fine... I was getting tired running after you!"},
    {"id": 302, "text": "Shit! This fucking shark ate him!"},
    {"id": 303, "text": "And we had to take him alive!"},
    {"id": 304, "text": "What can we do now?"},
    {"id": 305, "text": "Let's finish our job by destroying their base!"},
    {"id": 306, "text": "The Titanic!"},
    {"id": 307, "text": "So, that was them!"},
    {"id": 308, "text": "This time I'm really pissed off!"},
    {"id": 400, "text": "KILL 40 LAMMINGS!!!!"},
    {"id": 401, "text": "We have to hurry! No mercy for those bastards!"},
    {"id": 402, "text": "KILL 60 MORE!!!!"},
    {"id": 403, "text": "YOU HAVE NO TIME TO LOSE!"},
    {"id": 404, "text": "VERY IMPRESSIVE!"},
    {"id": 405, "text": "YOU CAN DO IT!"},
    {"id": 406, "text": "THIS IS REALLY AMAZING!"},
    {"id": 407, "text": "KEEP GOING!"},
    {"id": 408, "text": "WATCH OUT FOR THE LAST ASSAULT!"},
    {"id": 409, "text": "KILL 100 MORE LAMMINGS!!!"},
    {"id": 410, "text": "OH GOD! IT'S A REAL BLOOD BATH!"},
    {"id": 411, "text": "200 LAMMINGS KILLED!"},
    {"id": 412, "text": "YOU DID IT!"},
    {"id": 413, "text": "They killed themselves to avoid facing their own defeat."},
    {"id": 414, "text": "Yes, we have to admit that these Lammings are indeed worthy foes!"},
    {"id": 500, "text": "Princess Bitch! I should have guessed you were involved!"},
    {
      "id": 501,
      "text": "While you were fighting my bold soldiers, the five members of the high council unleashed a terrible assault on the main capitals of the free world."
    },
    {"id": 502, "text": "I'm not frightened by these so called members, coz I'm going to kill them anyway."},
    {"id": 503, "text": "They also destroyed every brewery in the entire world."},
    {"id": 504, "text": "These members are nuts! You’re gonna pay for what they did!"},
    {"id": 505, "text": "You slut!"},
    {"id": 506, "text": "No, Bitch, princess Bitch!"},
    {"id": 507, "text": "Just shut the fuck up!"},
    {"id": 520, "text": "I'm pretty sure this is the entrance to the high council headquarters."},
    {"id": 521, "text": "It is indeed! But you won't enter! You must not disturb the masters!"},
    {"id": 522, "text": "The masters? Tell us who they are or we're going to kick your ass!"},
    {"id": 523, "text": "You don't stand a chance, because I'm one of them. I'm known as the Dorkemons’ trainer."},
    {"id": 524, "text": "Ok, let's kick their asses first then!"},
    {"id": 525, "text": "Lazy artists... It really pisses me off!    "},
    {"id": 526, "text": "These guys have no respect for anything at all!"},
    {"id": 600, "text": "How did you enter? What have you done to my husband?"},
    {"id": 601, "text": "Looks like you've recently divorced."},
    {"id": 602, "text": "You are not welcome here!"},
    {"id": 603, "text": "You!"},
    {"id": 604, "text": "Yes it is I! Dario! Dario the plumber!"},
    {"id": 605, "text": "I would never have thought a stupid plumber would make such a mess..."},
    {
      "id": 606,
      "text": "After many years fixing broken toilets for appalling wages, I had had enough. Naturally I then planned to take over the world, so I created the high council with the help of my brother!"
    },
    {"id": 607, "text": "You should have stayed in your toilets in the first place."},
    {"id": 608, "text": "That's where you belong, you piece of shit."},
    {"id": 609, "text": "How dare you say that to the future ruler of the world?! I'm gonna kill you with my bare hands!"},
    {"id": 610, "text": "Dario, let me take care of these bastards!"},
    {"id": 611, "text": "Yeah, sure! Once you've killed them, go to the Big Mama's place. I'll be expecting you there.  "},
    {"id": 612, "text": "And what's coming next?"},
    {"id": 613, "text": "Let me guess... A hedgehog?"},
    {"id": 614, "text": "That's what I call fate..."},
    {"id": 615, "text": "Hedgehogs always die under the wheels of a car."},
    {"id": 700, "text": "There's no escape for you this time!"},
    {"id": 701, "text": "What did you expect by hiding yourself here?"},
    {"id": 702, "text": "You're clueless. I'm not trying to escape or to hide. I'm about to reach my goal."},
    {
      "id": 703,
      "text": "You're insane. Your armies are all destroyed; the high council is no more. What can you do on a useless stone drifting in space?"
    },
    {"id": 704, "text": "Drifting? Not for long, I'm going to change its course in order to strike planet earth itself!"},
    {"id": 705, "text": "You mean... you're going to destroy the whole planet?"},
    {"id": 706, "text": "Yeah! Since I'll never be the ruler of this world, I'm going to destroy it."},
    {"id": 707, "text": "You're totally insane!"},
    {"id": 708, "text": "Hey, that's cool! Today, we're going to save the world!"},
